cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BeeMyBlood, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "BeeMyBlood: an open platform connecting blood donors, recipients and transfusion professionals in Switzerland"
abstract: "BeeMyBlood is an open-source digital platform for the blood supply chain: a donor space (eligibility, centres, collections, game), a recipient space (transfusion journey, iron chelation, rights), a professional portal (stocks, cartography, rare phenotypes, digital twin), and Claude-based BeeBot assistants aligned with Swiss Red Cross transfusion criteria. Developed at Convivens Lab, HEG Geneva (HES-SO), with the Geneva University Hospitals transfusion centre, SIMED (University of Geneva) and Transfusion Interrégionale CRS."
